siders the possibility that the maximum magnitude outcome could be positive, and here in A there is a zero outcome (which has magnitude 0), it's not the maximum. So only -1000 and -500 are the maximum magnitude outcomes. Therefore, the reason prefers B because -500 is more favorable than -1000, and it occurs with higher probability (100% vs 50%). So the decision rule would prefer B.",
